       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    UTCSYSENAB.
       AUTHOR.        PD RAGLOW.
       INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  JANUARY 15, 1991.

      ****************************************************************
      *REMARKS.       VERIFIES, ENABLES, OR DISABLES A SYSTEM OPTION *
      *        IN THE GLOBAL MENU SYSTEM.                            *
      *       0-VERIFY EXISTENCE OF SYSTEM NAME IN GLOBAL MENU       *
      *       1-DISABLE THE NAMED GLOBAL MENU SYSTEM OPTION          *
      *       2-ENABLE THE NAMED GLOBAL MENU SYSTEM OPTION           *
      ****************************************************************

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT SYSTEM-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-UTFLMSI1
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  SYSTEM-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  SYSTEM-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF U0PRD-UTFLMSI1.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LS-SYSTEM-NAME       PIC X(10).
       01  LS-ACTION-CODE       PIC X.
       01  LS-RTN-CD            PIC XX.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION  USING LS-SYSTEM-NAME
                                 LS-ACTION-CODE
                                 LS-RTN-CD.
       BEGIN-HERE.
           IF LS-ACTION-CODE = "0"
               OPEN INPUT SYSTEM-FILE
           ELSE
               OPEN I-O SYSTEM-FILE.

           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE FILE-STATUS    TO LS-RTN-CD
               GO TO 2-END-JOB.

           PERFORM 6-MAIN  THRU 6-MAIN-EXIT.

       2-END-JOB.
           CLOSE  SYSTEM-FILE.
           GOBACK.

       6-MAIN.
           MOVE LS-SYSTEM-NAME TO SISYS.
           READ SYSTEM-FILE.
           MOVE FILE-STATUS    TO LS-RTN-CD.

           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               GO TO 6-MAIN-EXIT.

           IF LS-ACTION-CODE = "0"
               GO TO 6-MAIN-EXIT.

           IF LS-ACTION-CODE = "1"
               MOVE "N" TO SIACTF
               REWRITE SYSTEM-REC
               MOVE FILE-STATUS TO LS-RTN-CD
               GO TO 6-MAIN-EXIT.

           IF LS-ACTION-CODE = "2"
               MOVE "Y" TO SIACTF
               REWRITE SYSTEM-REC
               MOVE FILE-STATUS TO LS-RTN-CD
               GO TO 6-MAIN-EXIT.

       6-MAIN-EXIT.
           EXIT.
